flowchart TD
    User[Visitor] --> UI[Streamlit: Home / Owners / Pets / Personal calendar]
    UI --> Assistant[Persistent bottom-right assistant]
    Assistant --> Typed[Typed Gemini assistant]
    Assistant --> Live[Gemini Live: server-issued one-use credential]
    Typed --> Actions[Bounded Python tool dispatcher]
    Live --> Bridge[Correlated component event and tool receipt]
    Bridge --> Actions
    Actions --> Lookup[Read current local owners / pets / tasks / schedules]
    Lookup --> Store[(Local SQLite)]
    Actions --> Navigation[Select owner / pet / calendar date]
    Navigation --> UI
    Actions --> Preview[Server-held validated task preview]
    Preview --> Confirm{Explicit confirmation of latest details}
    Confirm --> Save[Registered pet / conflict checks / save once / readback]
    Save --> Store
    Save --> Receipt[Actual saved-task receipt]
    Receipt --> Assistant
    Receipt --> UI
    UI --> Dialog[Text-only task dialog: Conversation / Manual]
    Dialog --> Draft[Editable task draft]
    Draft --> DialogConfirm{Confirm and save}
    DialogConfirm --> Save
    DialogConfirm -->|close without saving| Retain[Retain independent temporary drafts]
    Assistant -->|stop or minimize| Release[Release microphone and keep conversation]
